            mcFx(()->{mcInvoke(mcWindow,"mcShowGenerator");((ComboBox<MCTemplate>)mcValue(mcWindow,"mcGenerateTemplate")).getSelectionModel().selectFirst();mcInvoke(mcWindow,"mcBuildDynamicForm");Map<String,Control> mcFields=mcValue(mcWindow,"mcInputs");((TextField)mcFields.get("razon_social")).textProperty().addListener((mcO,mcA,mcB)->{if(mcB.equals("ACME"))mcCompleted.complete(null);});((TextField)mcFields.get("razon_social")).setText("Dato anterior");((TextField)mcFields.get("ruc_empresa")).setText("20123456789");return null;});mcCompleted.get(20,TimeUnit.SECONDS);
